WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.270
Remember benchmarks: 50 percent is a half, 25 percent is a quarter, 10 percent is a

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.925
tenth and 75 percent is three quarters.

00:00:09.783 --> 00:00:19.898
Find 25 percent of 100. The answer is 25. 25 percent equals 25/100, so 100 times

00:00:19.898 --> 00:00:21.794
25/100 equals 25.

00:00:22.617 --> 00:00:28.579
For a total of 100 items during a sports day, what is 25 percent? Pause the video and

00:00:28.579 --> 00:00:28.910
think.

00:00:29.783 --> 00:00:39.068
For a total of 100 items during a sports day, what is 25 percent? The answer is 25.

00:00:39.068 --> 00:00:44.226
25 percent equals 25/100, so 100 times 25/100 equals 25.
